{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"代数叠"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"代数叠"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>代数叠</strong>又叫 <strong>Artin 叠</strong>, 是仿射概形的范畴上一类特殊的"},{"Local":{"url":"叠","text":"叠"}},{"Plain":", 具有平坦 (光滑) 坐标卡以及适当的可表性.</p>\n"}]}}